    },
    {
      "displayText": "仙子伊布布有了反應。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED95B504F0A5E035E0367094E8653CD61C9300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仙子伊布布能從觸角送出\n讓對方心情平和的波動。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED95B504F0A5E035E0380FD5F9E89F889D2900151FA000A8B935C0D65B95FC360C55E73548C76846CE252D5300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "簡而言之，透過傳送波動，\n牠能夠平息紛爭。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C21800C8A004E4BFF0C900F904E50B390016CE252D5FF0C000A726080FD59205E73606F7D1B722D300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而此時此刻，我感受到了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C6B6466426B64523BFF0C6211611F53D752304E86300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這一帶怒氣瀰漫，\n醜陋的鬥爭正在發生……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E005E3660126C2370306F2BFF0C000A919C964B76849B25722D6B635728767C751F20262026FF0100100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是，就是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662FFF0C5C31662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF0100100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們一起靠著仙子伊布布的力量\n幫大家將心情平和下來，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n讓紛爭平息吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150114E008D77976084574ED95B504F0A5E035E037684529B91CF000A5E6B59275BB65C075FC360C55E73548C4E0B4F86FF0C00100001BE00000A8B937D1B722D5E73606F5427FF0100100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
