      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F86901988E14E266C9267097D1B722D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿`",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 5088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼回事！\n沒有任何人在爭執啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 5100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC56DE4E8BFF01000A6C9267094EFB4F554EBA5728722D57F7554A300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒辦法發揮能力，\n仙子伊布布也煩躁躁的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 5144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C928FA66CD5767C63EE80FD529BFF0C000A4ED95B504F0A5E035E034E5F71698E818E817684300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "芙咿……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 5196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "829954BF20262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仙子伊布布你也太令人失望了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n即使沒有爭執，\n也該用你的愛的力量硬是讓他們<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n更加更加地心情平和才是！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 5208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED95B504F0A5E035E034F604E5F592A4EE44EBA5931671B4E86FF0100100001BE01000A53734F7F6C926709722D57F7FF0C000A4E5F8A7275284F607684611B7684529B91CF786C662F8B934ED6501100100001BE00000A66F452A066F452A057305FC360C55E73548C624D662FFF0100100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "芙咿……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 5332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "829954BF20262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請不要爭執了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 102,
      "offsetInSection": 5344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB4E0D8981722D57F74E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要心情平和啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 103,
      "offsetInSection": 5360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815FC360C55E73548C554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算事情不如意，\n我也不該遷怒給仙子伊布布。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 104,
      "offsetInSection": 5376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B974E8B60C54E0D5982610FFF0C000A62114E5F4E0D8A72907760127D664ED95B504F0A5E035E03300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我打從心底道歉。\n仙子伊布布，對不起喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 105,
      "offsetInSection": 5432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621162535F9E5FC35E9590536B493002000A4ED95B504F0A5E035E03FF0C5C0D4E0D8D775594300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "芙咿♡",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 106,
      "offsetInSection": 5484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "829954BF26610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳喔！\n如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳想要讓仙子伊布成為夥伴的話……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 107,
      "offsetInSection": 5492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B35594FF01000A5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B360F389818B934ED95B504F0A5E03621070BA59254F3476848A712026202600100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "重要的是要讓伊布學會\n妖精屬性的招式喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
