      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 108,
      "offsetInSection": 5576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CD89817684662F89818B934F0A5E035B786703000A59967CBE5C6C6027768462DB5F0F5594300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要持續不斷地給予伊布愛情，\n總有一天<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也能獲得<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n像這孩子般的療癒仙子伊布喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 109,
      "offsetInSection": 5628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898163017E8C4E0D65B757307D664E884F0A5E03611B60C5FF0C000A7E3D67094E00592900100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F80FD73725F9700100001BE00000A50CF90195B695B50822C7684764276524ED95B504F0A5E035594300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來，仙子伊布布，\n我們今後也繼續把愛傳出去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
